  "finding": "A readiness-owned deadline that aborts an in-flight local Apple read can be wrapped by the transport as typed request_canceled. The readiness catch excludes AppErrors from the existing budget owner, losing the last observed blocked state.",
  "scope": "Local built-in Apple runner native read transport. No kernel awaitWithSignal call is needed on this route.",
  "classification": "Confirmed committed-source path, controlled same-boundary regression, and separately preserved actual952 natural60s native failure.",
